<title>USA: Moldova tenders for 14,000 T PL-480 bagged rice.</title>
<headline>Moldova tenders for 14,000 T PL-480 bagged rice.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moldova will tender Sept 25 for 14,000 tonnes U.S. long-grain milled rice in bags using PL-480 financing, the country's agent said.</p>
<p>Moldova seeks No. 2 grade or better rice for shipment between Nov 1 and 25.</p>
<p>Offers are due by 1400 EDT Sept 25, with results expected within 24 hours, it said.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720</p>
</text>
